# MIGRATION.md §4.1 — the 'borrowed' modifier was removed in 1.0.0.
# This is the *before* form of a program that compiled on 0.16.0: the modifier
# no longer lexes, so the parser reads 'borrowed' as an ordinary name and then
# does not expect the real identifier that follows it.
weave main into int:
    var borrowed x is 1
    return x
